# Project-local environment variable overrides.
# Copy to .Renviron to activate (R reads .Renviron automatically).
# Only include variables you actually want to override; blank assignments
# (e.g. HF_TOKEN=) can shadow working values in your global ~/.Renviron.
#
# ── Required ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# GitHub personal access token with read:org scope (used to download cFMD data)
# GITHUB_TOKEN=ghp_xxx
#
# ── Required for working directory resolution (optional if using Positron / VS Code) ──
# CFMD_BENCH_WORKDIR=/path/to/cFMDbench
#
# ── Required only when using tabpfn ──────────────────────────────────────────
# TABPFN_CONDA_ROOT=/path/to/miniconda3
# TABPFN_ENV_NAME=cfmdbench-tabpfn-gpu
# HF_TOKEN=hf_xxx
